# App Shell (shared)

**When to @ tag:** Cross-page refactors, navigation, sidebar, or anything touching multiple tabs. Prefer the page chat that owns the feature when the change is really one screen.

## Monolith + layout

- `app/page.tsx` — entire app UI; all `activeTab` routes. Identify which tab you’re editing and stay in that page’s chat when possible.
- `app/layout.tsx`
- `app/globals.css`

## Shared components

- `components/AddressAutocomplete.tsx` — Pipeline, Canvassing, Estimates
- `components/PhoneInput.tsx` — Pipeline, Settings

## Shared lib

- `lib/supabase.ts`
- `lib/supabase/client.ts`
- `lib/supabase/server.ts`
- `lib/pricingGuide.ts` — owned by **Company Pricing** for edits; Estimates / Orders / Takeoff consume
- `lib/app-settings-sync.ts` — Settings, Calendar, Tasks
- `lib/geocode.ts`
- `lib/phone.ts`

## Config

- `middleware.ts`
- `next.config.ts`
- `tsconfig.json`
- `package.json`

